<title>UK: Hoogovens sets 300 mln Dfl convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens sets 300 mln Dfl convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KONINKLIJKE HOOGOVENS NV</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON  **4.5-4.875  MATURITY   *24.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	IND PREM   15-20 PCT PRICNG DATE 18.APR.97</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED. *CALLABLE FROM 24.APR.00 SUBJECT TO 130</p>
<p>		PCT RULE. THERE IS A 15 PCT GREENSHOE OPTION</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE FROM 1.JUL.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
